#: ../../source/rtk/getting-started/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"请选择设备铭牌或订单中的完整产品型号。每个流程只覆盖一个硬件和差分链路组合， "
"从核对配件开始，以持续输出定位数据并进入 RTK 固定解为完成判据。"
msgstr ""
"Select the full model number from the device label or order. Each guide "
"covers one hardware and correction-link combination, from checking the "
"package contents to continuous positioning output and an RTK fixed solution."
